    "displayName": "Contact Page",
    "description": "All editable content on /contact (Figma node 637:10433, file foaJFuv0vRX8nD43o0ylgB) — a dedicated singleType, not a `page` dynamiczone entry. The form's own fields (Name/Email/Phone/Company) are fixed UI chrome, never CMS content, same convention as every other lead form on this site."
